---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses & DLC Update | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="The Panther Statue returns to Cayo Perico! Plus GTA$1,000,000 login bonuses, 2X payout boosts, new Cayo Perico modes, and updated showroom vehicles."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range" style="text-align: center; color: var(--white-med); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;">August 6, 2026 — August 12, 2026</p>
            
        <!-- Modernized Highlight Box -->
        <div style="background: rgba(38, 30, 62, 0.4); 
                    border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-pink); 
                    padding: 25px; 
                    margin-top: 20px; 
                    text-align: left; 
                    border-radius: 12px; 
                    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); 
                    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--white-low);">
                    A new GTA Online event starts on August 6 (available through August 12). The Panther Statue returns to El Rubio's vault and completing the Cayo Perico Heist Finale earns you the Panther Tour Jacket. Assault on Cayo Perico and Cayo Perico Zombie Survival return, while weekly completion bonuses reset for all other Heists and Contact Missions. Also play this week to receive the End of Summer Giveaway bonus of GTA$1,000,000 within 72 hours.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Survive three waves in Cayo Perico Survival to get the Noise Rockstar Logo Aged Tee and GTA$100,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Log In Unlocks:</strong> Sunset Glow Necklace, Blue & Pink Glow Shades, and GTA$1,000,000 login bonus</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Cayo Perico Target:</strong> 100% chance of finding the Panther Statue on first playthrough of The Cayo Perico Heist Finale</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Completion Bonus:</strong> Complete The Cayo Perico Heist Finale to receive the Panther Tour Jacket</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>New Community Mission:</strong> Escape The City by Zibulaatio</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Mission Series (PS5, XBOX Series X|S, and PC Enhanced)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$:</strong> First-Time Completion for The Cayo Perico Heist Finale</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> A Superyacht Life Missions and Assault on Cayo Perico</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>60% OFF:</strong> Paleto Bay Business Properties, Karin Kuruma (Armored), and Karin Kuruma</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> High End Apartments and Benny's Conversion Upgrades</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Albany Cavalcade XL, BF Weevil, Brute Armored Boxville, Canis Castigator, Dinka Kanjo SJ, HVY Vetir, Lampadati Toro, Obey 8F Drafter, Pegassi Reaper, Pfister Comet Safari, and Progen Itali GTB</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF):</strong> Heavy Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF GTA+):</strong> Combat Shotgun</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Service Carbine, Compact Rifle, Heavy Pistol, Battle Axe, Tear Gas, Grenades & Sticky Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Declasse Drift Tampa</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Coil Raiden (Win in the LS Car Meet Series for four days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Albany Cavalcade XL, BF Weevil, Canis Castigator, Dinka Kanjo SJ & Obey 8F Drafter</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Annis Hardy & Grotti Cartuccia GT</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Pegassi Reaper, Pfister Comet Safari & Progen Itali GTB</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Übermacht Sentinel XS</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Business Trip</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Fort Zancudo (Standard) & Ron Alternates to Elysian Island (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                 <h3 style="font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 140, 27, 0.4);">Heists & Robberies</h3>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> Brother Brother, The Girl With the Pearl Necklace, In Excess of Success</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Project Breakaway File</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier - Claimable):</strong> The Gangbanger Robbery - Lampadati Tigon</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The McTony Robbery - Obey 10F</div>
                 <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Classique Broadway</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center;">
            <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent-pink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>